---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout title="Inicio">
	<section class="hero-mosaic animate-in">
		<div class="mosaic-bg">
			<div class="blob blob-1 float"></div>
			<div class="blob blob-2 float" style="animation-delay: -1s;"></div>
			<div class="blob blob-3 float" style="animation-delay: -2s;"></div>
		</div>

		<div class="hero-content">
			<div class="pre-title">
				<span class="line"></span>
				<span class="tag fancy-text">The Scientific Mosaic</span>
			</div>
			<h1>Decoding the Future of <br/><span class="gradient-text">Cellular Engineering.</span></h1>
			<p class="description">A collective of visionary scientists and engineers building the next generation of bio-integrated technologies.</p>
			<div class="actions">
				<a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/events`} class="btn primary">Próximos Eventos <span class="material-icons">event</span></a>
				<a href="https://github.com/cbs-unmsm" target="_blank" class="btn secondary">Repositorio Técnico</a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="scroll-explore">
			<span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE</span>
			<div class="scroll-line">
				<div class="line-progress"></div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="impacto" class="impact-section animate-in" style="animation-delay: 0.2s">
		<div class="section-header">
			<h2 class="gradient-text">Nuestra Labor en Cifras y Hechos</h2>
			<p>Modularidad, transparencia y excelencia en cada paso del camino.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="bento-grid">
			<div class="bento-item glass wide featured">
				<div class="content">
					<span class="category">Hito Semanal</span>
					<h3>Consolidación del Hub CBS</h3>
					<p>Hemos implementado una arquitectura federada que centraliza nuestras actividades, eventos y gestión académica en un solo núcleo digital.</p>
					<a href={`${base}/events`} class="link-arrow">Ver eventos →</a>
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<div class="bento-item glass">
				<div class="content">
					<span class="category">Comunidad</span>
					<h3>+20 Miembros</h3>
					<p>Estudiantes y egresados multidisciplinarios de la UNMSM.</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="bento-item glass tall">
				<div class="content">
					<span class="category">Misión</span>
					<h3>Rigor & Gestión</h3>
					<p>Cada actividad y protocolo de nuestra comunidad sigue un proceso de revisión exhaustivo, asegurando que la gestión académica mantenga el estándar de la Decana de América.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="visual-accent dna-helix"></div>
			</div>

			<div class="bento-item glass">
				<div class="content">
					<span class="category">Próximo</span>
					<h3>Webinar SynBio</h3>
					<p>Nuevas fronteras en edición génica. Pronto más info.</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="bento-item glass wide">
				<div class="content">
					<span class="category">Proyectos</span>
					<h3>Gestión Académica</h3>
					<p>Nuestros protocolos internos y repositorios de gestión administrativa están centralizados para garantizar la transparencia y eficiencia del grupo.</p>
					<a href="https://github.com/cbs-unmsm" target="_blank" class="link-arrow">Explorar GitHub ↗</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	/* Hero Mosaic Style */
	.hero-mosaic {
		position: relative;
		min-height: 100vh;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		padding-top: 2rem;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.mosaic-bg {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		z-index: 1; /* Bajo el contenido */
		opacity: 0.4; /* Reducido para mejor contraste */
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.blob {
		position: absolute;
		background-size: cover;
		background-position: center;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(var(--accent-purple-rgb), 0.3);
		filter: brightness(0.6) saturate(1.2); /* Optimizado para legibilidad */
	}

	.blob-1 {
		width: 300px;
		height: 300px;
		top: 15%;
		left: 5%;
		border-radius: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%;
		background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--cbs-blue-corp), var(--cbs-emerald));
	}

	.blob-2 {
		width: 350px;
		height: 350px;
		bottom: 10%;
		left: 20%;
		border-radius: 30% 60% 70% 40% / 50% 60% 30% 60%;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cbs-emerald), var(--cbs-blue-night));
	}

	.blob-3 {
		width: 450px;
		height: 450px;
		top: 10%;
		right: 5%;
		border-radius: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%;
		background: linear-gradient(-45deg, var(--cbs-blue-corp), var(--cbs-gold));
	}

	.hero-content {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 20; /* Asegurar que esté sobre todo */
		max-width: 850px;
		padding: 0 2rem;
		text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); /* Sombra para legibilidad */
	}

	.pre-title {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.pre-title .line {
		width: 50px;
		height: 1px;
		background: var(--accent-cyan);
	}

	.pre-title .tag {
		font-family: var(--font-fancy);
		font-size: 1.8rem;
		font-weight: 400;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		text-transform: none;
		color: var(--accent-cyan);
	}

	h1 {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem);
		line-height: 1;
		font-weight: 800;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
	}

	.description {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		max-width: 550px;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
		opacity: 0.8;
		line-height: 1.6;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
	}

	.actions {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.btn {
		padding: 1.2rem 2.5rem;
		border-radius: 12px;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
	}

	.btn.primary {
		background: var(--cbs-blue-corp);
		color: white;
		box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(21, 79, 155, 0.4);
	}

	.btn.secondary {
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		color: var(--text-color);
		backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
	}

	.btn:hover {
		transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.02);
		box-shadow: 0 15px 40px var(--accent-glow);
	}

	.scroll-explore {
		position: absolute;
		bottom: 120px;
		right: 3rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: row-reverse;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.2em;
		opacity: 0.5;
	}

	.scroll-line {
		width: 60px;
		height: 1px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
		position: relative;
	}

	.line-progress {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		height: 100%;
		width: 30%;
		background: var(--accent-cyan);
		animation: pulse 2s infinite ease-in-out;
	}

	@keyframes pulse {
		0% { transform: scaleX(0.5); opacity: 0.5; }
		50% { transform: scaleX(1.5); opacity: 1; }
		100% { transform: scaleX(0.5); opacity: 0.5; }
	}

	/* Bento Grid 2.0 */
	.impact-section {
		padding: 8rem 0;
	}
	.section-header {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 5rem;
	}
	.section-header h2 {
		font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}
	.bento-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
		grid-auto-rows: 240px;
		gap: 2rem;
	}
	.bento-item {
		position: relative;
		padding: 2.5rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		justify-content: flex-end;
		overflow: hidden;
		transition: all 0.4s ease;
	}
	.bento-item:hover {
		transform: translateY(-10px);
		border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
		box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.2);
	}
	.bento-item.wide { grid-column: span 2; }
	.bento-item.tall { grid-row: span 2; }
	.bento-item.featured {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(var(--accent-purple-rgb), 0.15), rgba(var(--accent-cyan-rgb), 0.15));
		border-color: rgba(var(--accent-purple-rgb), 0.3);
	}

	.category {
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		font-weight: 800;
		letter-spacing: 0.15em;
		color: var(--accent-cyan);
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		display: block;
	}
	.bento-item h3 {
		font-size: 1.8rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		color: var(--accent-yellow);
		line-height: 1.2;
	}
	.bento-item p {
		font-size: 1rem;
		margin: 0;
		opacity: 0.8;
		text-align: left;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}
	.link-arrow {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		display: inline-block;
		color: var(--text-color);
		font-weight: 700;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}
	.link-arrow:hover {
		color: var(--accent-cyan);
		padding-left: 5px;
	}

	.visual-accent {
		position: absolute;
		top: -20px;
		right: -20px;
		width: 150px;
		height: 150px;
		background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--accent-glow) 0%, transparent 70%);
		opacity: 0.3;
		z-index: -1;
	}

	@media (max-width: 1100px) {
		.bento-grid {
			grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
			grid-auto-rows: auto;
		}
	}
</style>
